">$1.25M</div>\n          <div class=\"safe\">Pre-Seed SAFE</div>\n          <div class=\"left-copy\">\n            A finite proof-stage round sized to convert product readiness into repeatable deployment evidence.\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"tag-row\">\n            <div class=\"tag\">Post-money SAFE</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\">Milestone-based use</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"proof-box\">\n            <p>\n              Capital is tied to a defined proof plan: build only what is needed for launch, deploy in real\n              clinical settings, and validate enough value to support repeatable expansion.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-grid\">\n            <div class=\"mini-cell\">\n              <div class=\"mini-title\">2 core hires to support implementation and deployment</div>\n              <div class=\"mini-copy\">Founding engineering + implementation ownership for live rollout and learning loops.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mini-cell\">\n              <div class=\"mini-title\">3 pilot sites to establish live operational proof</div>\n              <div class=\"mini-copy\">Enough real usage to show deployment can repeat, not just happen once.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mini-cell\">\n              <div class=\"mini-title\">18–20 months of runway to execute and measure outcomes</div>\n              <div class=\"mini-copy\">Time to launch, instrument, improve, and package the results for seed readiness.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"right-area\">\n          <div class=\"metrics\">\n            <div class=\"metric\">\n              <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n              <div class=\"label\">key hires</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"metric\">\n              <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n              <div class=\"label\">pilot sites</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"metric\">\n              <div class=\"num\">18–20</div>\n              <div class=\"label\">months runway</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"section-title\">What this round unlocks</div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"m-row\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"m-left-top\">\n                  <div class=\"badge\">Build</div>\n                  <div class=\"m-title\">Pilot-ready deployment foundation</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"chip-row\">\n                  <div class=\"chip\">founding engineer hired</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">implementation + customer success hire</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">clinician-grade product loop live</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">pilot onboarding workflows</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">site-specific deployment readiness</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">reporting and operational instrumentation</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"m-summary\">\n                Complete the minimum product and workflow layer required to go live reliably.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"m-row\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"m-left-top\">\n                  <div class=\"badge\">Deploy</div>\n                  <div class=\"m-title\">Launch 3 pilot sites</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"chip-row\">\n                  <div class=\"chip\">implementation lead in place</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">live pilot implementations</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">provider and staff onboarding</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">repeatable rollout motion</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">site feedback loop into product</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"m-summary\">\n                Demonstrate that Designer can be implemented and used in real visit environments.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"m-row\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"m-left-top\">\n                  <div class=\"badge\">Validate</div>\n                  <div class=\"m-title\">Prove value and repeatability</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"chip-row\">\n                  <div class=\"chip\">measured pilot outcomes</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">usage and workflow adoption signals</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">time / operational value metrics</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">referenceable pilot outcomes</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">seed-ready proof package</div>\n                  <div class=\"chip\">clear next-round proof points</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"m-summary\">\n                Generate the evidence needed to move from first pilots to a repeatable deployment motion.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"timeline\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-line\"></div>\n          <div class=\"phase p1\">\n            <div class=\"phase-label\">Build</div>\n            <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"phase-copy\">Make deployment possible</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"phase p2\">\n            <div class=\"phase-label\">Deploy</div>\n            <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"phase-copy\">Run in real sites</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"phase p3\">\n            <div class=\"phase-label\">Validate</div>\n            <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"phase-copy\">Package proof for seed</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ribbon\">\n          <div class=\"ribbon-title\">Use of funds</div>\n          <div class=\"alloc\">\n            <div class=\"alloc-item\">\n              <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width: 46%;\"></div></div>\n              <div class=\"alloc-label\">Team</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alloc-item\">\n              <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width: 24%;\"></div></div>\n              <div class=\"alloc-label\">Pilot deployment</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alloc-item\">\n              <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width: 37%;\"></div></div>\n              <div class=\"alloc-label\">Product &amp; data infrastructure</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alloc-item\">\n              <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width: 16%;\"></div></div>\n              <div class=\"alloc-label\">Validation / operating buffer</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ribbon-note\">This round funds a concrete proof plan — not scale before proof.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <img\n        class=\"footer-logo\"\n        src=\"../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      />\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>"
